code_excerpts.excerpt:
C = candidate; R = implementation result (parent(R)=C, NO envelope);
E = envelope container (parent(E)=R, EXACTLY the envelope);
remote branch -> E; only R is integration-eligible;
envelope fields: candidate_commit_oid, implementation_result_commit_oid,
implementation_result_tree_oid, git_object_format (never E's own identity)
